    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the criminal procedure law, the civil practice law and rules\nand the executive law, in relation to the possession of opioid antagonists",
    "basePrintNo": "S911",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S911-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
